  "plain": "In 1947 at Roswell, New Mexico, where the Army air base announced it had recovered a 'flying disc' and then took the statement back, the staff of the base were visibly spooked, according to a man whose grandfather served there in the 9th Atomic Bomber Squadron. Michels relays this from the founder of a Fortune 500 company, whom he does not name, while talking with the UFO documentary maker James Fox; if true, it would mean those on the base knew something more than a balloon had come down."
